            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row g-4">
            <div class="col-md-4 d-flex">
                <div class="card card-hover-svg w-100 text-center h-100  border border-3">
                    <div class="card-body p-4 d-flex flex-column align-items-center">
                        <span class="display-4 fw-bold text-primary">1</span>
                        <h5 class="mt-3 fw-semibold">Enter Your Info</h5>
                        <p>Fill in your experience, skills, and preferences in a simple form.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4 d-flex">
                <div class="card card-hover-svg w-100 text-center h-100  border border-3">
                    <div class="card-body p-4 d-flex flex-column align-items-center">
                        <span class="display-4 fw-bold text-success">2</span>
                        <h5 class="mt-3 fw-semibold">AI Builds for You</h5>
                        <p>Our AI crafts a professional resume or portfolio tailored to your profile.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4 d-flex">
                <div class="card card-hover-svg w-100 text-center h-100  border border-3">
                    <div class="card-body p-4 d-flex flex-column align-items-center">
                        <span class="display-4 fw-bold text-warning">3</span>
                        <h5 class="mt-3 fw-semibold">Download & Share</h5>
                        <p>Export to PDF or share your online portfolio link with employers or clients.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>




<!-- Contact Section -->
